<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 823)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Stills show as recorded: a PNG, JPEG or TIFF was reading far too dark through the ACES view, on screen and in grabs. Its default input space is now <b>Output - sRGB</b>; if you had changed a still&#8217;s space to compensate, set it back.</li>
<li>Maintenance, in step with Asobi 0.9 (823).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
